AI-Assisted Campus Digital Magazine

Project Overview

Campus Connect is a digital magazine designed to share useful educational information with college students. AI tools can assist with brainstorming, drafting, and organizing content, while the student reviews and edits the final material.

Objectives

- Create a digital magazine for college students.
- Share study tips, responsible AI guidance, student project ideas, and career information.
- Use AI tools responsibly to support content creation.
- Present the magazine in a clear, student-friendly format.

Magazine Sections

1. Study Smart
2. Responsible AI
3. Student Projects
4. Career Corner

Tools

- GitHub — project file hosting
- An AI writing assistant — brainstorming and drafting
- Canva or a similar design tool — magazine layout
- Google Drive — submission and file sharing

Responsible AI

AI-generated content must be reviewed for accuracy. Personal information and copyrighted material should be handled carefully. Any facts or announcements should be verified before publication.

Project Status

This repository is being developed as part of a college project. The completed magazine and supporting files will be added as they are prepared.
